# NOTE: `build*/` matches ANY directory starting with "build", not just
# build/ -- it has silently swallowed packaging/br2-external/ (was
# buildroot/) and br-patches/ (was buildroot-patches/).  If a directory
# you added is mysteriously absent from a fresh clone, check this first,
# and check with `git ls-files`, not `find`.
build*/
# build-image.sh's default NN_WORK (multi-GB: Buildroot tree, kernel tarball,
# output images).  Note `build*/` above does NOT match a leading underscore.
_build/

# Generated TI derivatives -- tools are in git, their output is not.
# Both are derived from files under the TEXAS INSTRUMENTS TEXT FILE LICENSE,
# which allows derivative works only "for use only with TI Devices" and
# requires the licence to be reproduced with any redistribution.  Building and
# running them on the AM67A is fine; committing them here would be a
# redistribution decision.  Regenerate with:
#   python3 packaging/mk-selftest-rgb.py                 -> board/selftest.rgb
board/selftest.gray
#   python3 packaging/mk-imx708-dcc.py <ti-dcc> board/dcc_viss_imx708.bin
board/selftest.rgb
board/selftest.gray
board/dcc_viss_imx708.bin
packaging/__pycache__/
